      "created_at" : "Sun Aug 03 14:56:41 +0000 2025",
      "favorited" : false,
      "full_text" : "🐳”It is secure, self-healing and resilient, with 100% uptime for nearly a decade. It can currently cope well with daily demand even during peaks, but scaling must be a priority; faster transactions and to remove future bottlenecks. “",
      "lang" : "en",
