      "full_text" : "Until y’all can develop revenue streams for wallets and governance tooling apps we need to subsidize them.  I would prefer for them to be free of advertisements, pay walls or service fees.  I don’t know if we want the Taptools mode as the norm. Advertisement + paywall != adoption",
