      "created_at" : "Sat Aug 16 15:41:13 +0000 2025",
      "favorited" : false,
      "full_text" : "Loss of Authentic Self: suppress their true personality, desires, or emotions to meet the expectations\n\nEmotional Isolation: create distance from peers.\n\nWe need to protect our “Golden Child” diversify your delegation of responsibilities. There’s an army of capable DReps waiting",
