      "favorited" : false,
      "full_text" : "“The incentive structure is circular: delegation creates financial dependency, financial dependency discourages dissent, and the absence of dissent enables more spending.\nI'm not saying it's a conspiracy. I'm saying it's a system that doesn't require one.“☝️ https://t.co/h9vdHK7D8b",
