      "created_at" : "Wed Mar 18 17:41:42 +0000 2026",
      "favorited" : false,
      "full_text" : "In the last 18 epochs from 600-618 we lost 40 DReps = &gt;12 million ADA in voting power, this is just from DReps with 1 million or less in delegation.\n\nSmaller DReps are leaving the pitch and heading for the stands.\n\nI wonder what Ekklesia participation will look like.",
      "lang" : "en"
